{
  "version": "1",
  "text": "This ensemble is crafted for a moment of deep respect and solemnity. The herringbone cardigan in black with its beige lining brings a soft, textured warmth to your frame, while the graphite trousers provide a clean, structured silhouette that balances the volume of the top perfectly on your shape A. The mocha trench coat wraps around you with a classic authority, its high collar adding a sense of protection and dignity suitable for the occasion, and the black clutch rests at your side, understated and refined. Your footwear, the brown ballet flats, bridges the gap between comfort and elegance, allowing you to stand or move gently through this significant day. Every piece is chosen to honor the gravity of the gathering while ensuring you feel supported and present.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Wear the trench coat open over the cardigan to let its structured shoulders frame your face, then fasten the belt at the natural waist to anchor the look before taking it off once inside."
  ],
  "wrong_photos": [],
  "swap": {},
  "named": [],
  "about_items": [
    {
      "n": "#434·30",
      "text": "A woolen cardigan with a lapel collar and a matching belt, presented in black. The fabric is woven in a subtle herringbone pattern, while the inner lining of the lapel and the sleeve cuffs are solid beige, creating a soft contrast against the dark outer shell."
    },
    {
      "n": "#87·12",
      "text": "Classic straight trousers in graphite, cut with a tailored fit that flows cleanly from the hip to the ankle. The fabric has a matte finish and holds its structure well, offering a polished line that sits comfortably on your figure."
    },
    {
      "n": "#393·06",
      "text": "An origami clutch made from textured leather, finished in black. It features a smooth front panel contrasted by a back panel with an embossed crocodile pattern, fastened with a simple magnetic closure and carrying a subtle debossed logo."
    },
    {
      "n": "#214·07",
      "text": "Ballet flats in brown, adorned with all-over sparkling sequins that catch the light. The shoe features a classic slip-on silhouette with a single strap across the instep secured by a small silver buckle and a flexible sole for quiet steps."
    },
    {
      "n": "#263·12",
      "text": "A cropped classic trench coat in mocha, designed with wide lapels, large buttons, and epaulets on the shoulders. It includes a self-fabric belt with a metal buckle to define the waist and offers a structured yet comfortable silhouette."
    }
  ]
}
